1
00:00:00,853 --> 00:00:03,563
(Penny:)...then the other fella
went bat-crap crazy.

2
00:00:04,148 --> 00:00:05,898
(Leonard:)So you agree he's nuts.

3
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:08,647
(Penny:)Not as nuts as the guy
who chooses to live with him.

4
00:00:08,819 --> 00:00:11,159
(Leonard:)Believe it or not,
he was worse when I met him.

5
00:00:11,322 --> 00:00:13,492
(Penny:)Oh, I do not believe that.

6
00:00:13,824 --> 00:00:16,114
You are so naive.

7
00:00:16,285 --> 00:00:18,115
Just like I was seven years ago.

8
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:22,420
I'd just started at the university.

9
00:00:27,797 --> 00:00:31,007
(Past Leonard:)Excuse me, I'm looking
for Sheldon Cooper's apartment.

10
00:00:31,175 --> 00:00:33,595
(Man with a box:)-Oh. I bet you're here to check out the room.
-Yeah.

11
00:00:33,761 --> 00:00:35,641
(Man:)Run away, dude.

12
00:00:37,139 --> 00:00:40,939
(Past Leonard:)-What?
-Run fast, run far.

13
00:00:42,186 --> 00:00:46,026
That should've been my first clue.

